OL,3,GNEWSABomb squad neutralise 'suspicious'
OL,4,Aitem
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of a busy city centre has been
OL,7,Fcordoned off by police as a bomb
OL,8,Fdisposal team neutralised a suspicious
OL,9,Fitem with a controlled explosion.
OL,11,FPark Street in Bristol has been closed
OL,12,Fafter a member of the public reported a
OL,13,Fman leaving a suspicious item in the
OL,14,Farea at about 08:25 BST on Friday.
OL,16,FAvon and Somerset Police said a 50m
OL,17,F(164 ft) cordon is in place, which
OL,18,Fincludes Hill Street, St George's Road
OL,19,Fand Frogmore Street.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
