OL,3,GNEWSABomb squad neutralise 'suspicious'
OL,4,Aitem
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police spokesperson said: "We have
OL,7,Fnotified the explosive ordnance
OL,8,Fdisposal unit, who will be attending
OL,9,Fthe area to conduct further enquiries."
